---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
---
<SiteLayout page="about" title="About FlameWM — The desktop, considered." description="Meet FlameWM: an independent, open-source Rust desktop and window manager developed by ArkFlame Studios.">
<section class="subhero"><div class="container subhero-inner" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow red">ABOUT FLAMEWM</span><h1>Less desktop.<br /><em>More possibility.</em></h1><p>We believe a lightweight desktop can be welcoming, beautiful and ready to use from the first moment.</p></div></section>
<section class="about-story"><div class="container about-story-grid"><div data-reveal><span class="eyebrow red">THE IDEA</span><h2>Lightweight shouldn’t mean unfinished.</h2></div><div data-reveal><p>FlameWM is an independent Rust window manager and desktop environment project developed by ArkFlame Studios for Linux. It takes inspiration from the efficiency of IceWM and the usability of familiar modern desktops, including KDE Plasma.</p><p>Our design direction is deliberately focused: a cohesive taskbar, capable window management, a real desktop surface, and settings for the things people actually change. No desktop assembly required.</p><p>FlameWM is in active development. Its interactive web demo is a design reference; it is not the installed native environment.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="values-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-title-center" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">OUR PRINCIPLES</span><h2>Built with intention.</h2></div><div class="values-grid"><article data-reveal><span>01</span><h3>Familiar.</h3><p>Common desktop tasks should need no introduction.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>02</span><h3>Focused.</h3><p>Prioritize the essential workflows. Leave the rest out of the way.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>03</span><h3>Lightweight.</h3><p>Keep background activity and system overhead in check.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>04</span><h3>Open.</h3><p>Build transparently and improve through shared work.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="about-brand"><div class="container about-brand-inner" data-reveal><img src={`${base}assets/brand/flamewm-mark.svg`} width="70" height="70" alt="" /><div><span class="eyebrow red">CREATED BY ARKFLAME STUDIOS</span><h2>FlameWM.</h2><p>A modern Linux desktop, made to feel at home.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ArkFlame/flamewm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow development ↗</a></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
